{"product_id":"the-hate-u-give-movie-tie-in-edition","title":"The Hate U Give Movie Tie-in Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe acclaimed, award-winning novel is now a major motion picture starring Amandla Stenberg, Russell Hornsby, Regina Hall, Anthony Mackie, Issa Rae, and Common.This edition features the movie poster art, full-color photos, and Angie Thomas in conversation with Amandla Stenberg and director George Tillman Jr.8 starred reviews 怪ｪ Goodreads Choice Awards Best of the Best 怪ｪ William C. Morris Award Winner 怪ｪ National Book Award Longlist 怪ｪ Printz Honor Book 怪ｪ Coretta Scott King Honor Book 怪ｪ #1 New York Times Bestseller! (60+ weeks on the list!)\"Absolutely riveting!\" 課ﾓJason Reynolds\"Stunning.\" 課ﾓJohn Green\"This story is necessary. This story is important.\" 課ﾓKirkus (starred review)\"Heartbreakingly topical.\" 課ﾓPublishers Weekly (starred review)\"A marvel of verisimilitude.\" 課ﾓBooklist (starred review)\"A powerful, in-your-face novel.\" 課ﾓHorn Book (starred review)Sixteen-year-old Starr Carter moves between two worlds: the poor neighborhood where she lives and the fancy suburban prep school she attends. The uneasy balance between these worlds is shattered when Starr witnesses the fatal shooting of her childhood best friend Khalil at the hands of a police officer. Khalil was unarmed.Soon afterward, his death is a national headline. Some are calling him a thug, maybe even a drug dealer and a gangbanger. Protesters are taking to the streets in Khalil課ｪs name. Some cops and the local drug lord try to intimidate Starr and her family. What everyone wants to know is: what really went down that night? And the only person alive who can answer that is Starr.But what Starr does課ﾓor does not課ﾓsay could upend her community. It could also endanger her life.And don't miss On the Come Up, Angie Thomas's powerful follow-up to The Hate U Give.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Angie Thomas\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062875686\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 480\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297348968601,"sku":"3RD9780062875686","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/TheHateUGiveMovieTie-inEditionAngieThomas.jpg?v=1752084519","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-hate-u-give-movie-tie-in-edition","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}